        "r": 533.47,
        "b": 706.2
      },
      "content": "NOTE: Never remove and then install a replacement DCC and formatter at the same time. Doing so will cause the printer to become unstable.",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2842",
      "reading_order": 3818,
      "section": "Removal and replacement: Formatter",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 696.79,
        "r": 527.1100100000003,
        "b": 673.2
      },
      "content": "If a replacement DCC and formatter must be installed, first remove and install the formatter. Test operate the printer, and then if necessary install a replacement DCC."
    },
