      "reading_order": 3834,
      "section": "Turn the printer power off",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 350.79,
        "r": 524.0700000000002,
        "b": 327.2
      },
      "content": "WARNING! To avoid damage to the printer, turn the printer off, wait 30 seconds, and then remove the power cord before attempting to service the printer.",
      "severity": "warning"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_2858",
      "reading_order": 3835,
      "section": "Turn the printer power off",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 313.79,
        "r": 536.12004,
        "b": 278.20000000000005
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Take note of all empty connectors on the PCA before disconnecting any wire harnesses or flatflexible cables (FFCs). Some empty connectors might not be visible until other items-like the hard-disk driveare removed, so pay close attention while removing the formatter and accessory items.",
      "severity": "important"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2859",
      "reading_order": 3836,
      "section": "Turn the printer power off",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 267.28999999999996,
        "r": 470.47000000000025,
        "b": 243.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "Use the table below to identify the correct part number for your printer . To order the part, go to www.hp.com/buy/parts."
